OL,5,G0310 Grand Designs
OL,6,     FPaul and Amy build a home made up
OL,7,     Fof five circular timber buildings
OL,8,     Flinked by raised walkways, beside
OL,9,     Fa Lincolnshire lake. But Paul's
OL,10,     Fhealth suffers as he struggles to
OL,11,     Ffinish it in a year.
OL,12,G0410 George Clarke's Building Home
OL,13,     FIn Radcliffe-on-Trent, Joel and
OL,14,     FNicola restore Joel's
OL,15,     Fgrandparents' 1970s Victorian
OL,16,     Fcottage and add a plush extension,
OL,17,     Fwith a stretched budget and a
OL,18,     Ftight Yuletide timeline.
